{"body":"<a href="#"><img alt="P1" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9" align="top"></a> **Unuse Partially Completes**

When `prune()` is called by a non-interactive `mise unuse` without `--yes`, this branch returns an error after `unuse` has already saved the configuration change. The command therefore removes the tool from configuration but skips the later shim rebuild and exits as a failure. Handle unavailable confirmation before committing the `unuse` change, or let that caller explicitly decline pruning.

<a href="https://app.greptile.com/ide/claude-code?prompt=This%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20src%2Fcli%2Fprune.rs%0ALine%3A%20214-216%0A%0AComment%3A%0A**Unuse%20Partially%20Completes**%0A%0AWhen%20%60prune%28%29%60%20is%20called%20by%20a%20non-interactive%20%60mise%20unuse%60%20without%20%60--yes%60%2C%20this%20branch%20returns%20an%20error%20after%20%60unuse%60%20has%20already%20saved%20the%20configuration%20change.%20The%20command%20therefore%20removes%20the%20tool%20from%20configuration%20but%20skips%20the%20later%20shim%20rebuild%20and%20exits%20as%20a%20failure.%20Handle%20unavailable%20confirmation%20before%20committing%20the%20%60unuse%60%20change%2C%20or%20let%20that%20caller%20explicitly%20decline%20pruning.%0A%0A---%0A%0AFor%20each%20issue%20above%2C%20determine%20whether%20it%20is%20valid%20and%20should%20be%20fixed.%20If%20so%2C%20fix%20it%20directly.&repo=jdx%2Fmise&pr=13003&platform=github"><picture><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInClaudeDark.svg?v=6"><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInClaude.svg?v=6"><img alt="Fix in Claude Code" src="https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInClaude.svg?v=6"></picture></a>","created_at":"2026-09-09T12:39:22Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/13003#discussion_r3968403314","id":3968403314,"in_reply_to_id":null,"line":240,"path":"src/cli/prune.rs","side":"RIGHT","user":"greptile-apps[bot]"}
